title: Trade Unions: a Dispute
subtitle: The workers demand a rise; PPS decides whether to fight for it.
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_event_strike_1923.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_union_rules && PolishUnions.disputeCardAvailable(Q) !}
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
// The card of a dispute (Z — 0.87, the user's decisions of 24 X 2026; technical reference 14.1–14.5; card catalogue 5.10): it
// describes the case that waits for PPS — the wage case of the towns or the harvest case of the agricultural labourers — and
// offers a strike, a threat or not taking up the fight; it is urgent in the Party deck while a dispute waits. A dispute of a
// branch with the leadership of PPS is mediated here too. The offer of the government comes on the card polish_strike_offer.
PolishUnions.disputeView(Q);
!}

= [+ pl_dsp_title +]

[+ pl_dsp_text +]

[? if pl_dsp_has_dispute : [+ pl_dsp_numbers +] ?]

[? if pl_dsp_has_dispute : [+ pl_dsp_note +] ?]

- @start
- @threaten
- @drop
- @mediate
- @easy_discard

@start
title: Start a strike
subtitle: You choose the goal of the strike, the cooperation with the communists and the protection of the Milicja.
view-if: pl_dsp_has_dispute = 1
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.startStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_dsp_start_why +]
go-to: setup

@threaten
title: Threaten a strike
subtitle: [+ pl_dsp_threat_line +]
view-if: pl_dsp_has_dispute = 1
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.threatStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_dsp_threat_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_union_result = PolishUnions.threaten(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@drop
title: Do not take up the fight
subtitle: [+ pl_dsp_drop_line +]
view-if: pl_dsp_has_dispute = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_union_result = PolishUnions.dropDispute(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@mediate
title: Mediate the dispute with the leadership
subtitle: This month's action; the branch's dissent over a concrete change falls (−8).
view-if: pl_dsp_has_leadership = 1
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.mediateStatus(Q, PolishUnions.disputeLeadershipBranch(Q)).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_dsp_mediate_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.mediate(Q, PolishUnions.disputeLeadershipBranch(Q));
!}
go-to: result

@setup
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupView(Q);
!}

= [+ pl_su_title +]

Mark the goal of the strike, the cooperation with the communists and the protection of the Milicja, then announce the strike.

- @g_small
- @g_big
- @g_political
- @c_no
- @c_yes
- @p_no
- @p_yes
- @launch
- @polish_union_agenda: Back to the dispute.

@g_small
title: [+ pl_su_g_small_mark +] Wages and working conditions
subtitle: The government gives way more easily (threshold 40). A win: wages in the branch rise for two months, the workers' grievance falls (−4) and the union's trust in PPS grows (+5).
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupChoose(Q, 'goal', 'small');
!}
go-to: setup

@g_big
title: [+ pl_su_g_big_mark +] Wages, working conditions and works councils
subtitle: Harder (threshold 60). A win: wages in the branch rise for two months, and the crews elect works councils with a say in the affairs of the plant: the grievance falls more (−8), the trust grows more (+10), the employers press harder (+3). The government may offer only wages and working conditions, without the councils.
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupChoose(Q, 'goal', 'big');
!}
go-to: setup

@g_political
title: [+ pl_su_g_political_mark +] The resignation of the cabinet
subtitle: A demonstrative strike: no cabinet resigns under the pressure of a strike, and the talks turn back to wages and working conditions. Under the line of independent class politics the dissent of the Left of PPS falls (−3); without it the Centre protests (+8).
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupChoose(Q, 'goal', 'political');
!}
go-to: setup

@c_no
title: [+ pl_su_c_no_mark +] Without the communists
subtitle: PPS leads the strike alone; the communists act on their own.
view-if: pl_su_communists = 1
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupChoose(Q, 'communists', false);
!}
go-to: setup

@c_yes
title: [+ pl_su_c_yes_mark +] Together with the communists
subtitle: [+ pl_su_c_yes_line +]
view-if: pl_su_communists = 1
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.setupWhy(Q, 'communists', true).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_su_c_yes_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupChoose(Q, 'communists', true);
!}
go-to: setup

@p_no
title: [+ pl_su_p_no_mark +] Without the protection of the Milicja
subtitle: The Milicja stays out of the strike.
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupChoose(Q, 'protection', false);
!}
go-to: setup

@p_yes
title: [+ pl_su_p_yes_mark +] Under the protection of the Milicja
subtitle: Half a unit of the party's money; fewer injured and arrested strikers in a clash with the police.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.setupWhy(Q, 'protection', true).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_su_p_yes_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.setupChoose(Q, 'protection', true);
!}
go-to: setup

@launch
title: Announce the strike
subtitle: [+ pl_su_launch_line +]
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.launchStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_su_launch_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_union_result = PolishUnions.launchStrike(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= The trade unions

[+ pl_union_result +]

- @root: Continue.
